# Exclude generated/build artifacts from Azure App Service zip deploy
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.git/
**/.DS_Store

# Project-specific folders not needed in server package
RentVibe/ClientApp/
RentVibe/probertyApp/

# Malformed Windows-style folder name that exists as a literal path on Linux
RentVibe/bin\\Debug/
